# Design System

## Token Usage (Mandatory)

| Need | Use | Never |
|------|-----|-------|
| Colors | `context.appColors.*` | `Colors.*`, hex literals |
| Typography | `context.appTypography.*` or `AppFont.*` | Raw `TextStyle(...)` |
| Spacing | `AppSpacing.*` | Raw `EdgeInsets`, numeric padding |
| Radius | `AppRadius.*` | Raw `BorderRadius.circular(n)` |
| Shadows | `AppShadows.*` | Raw `BoxShadow(...)` |
| Sizes | `AppDimension.*` | Raw `double` for icons/components |
| Durations | `AppDurations.*` | Raw `Duration(milliseconds: n)` |

## Components

Use existing DS components — never build equivalents from scratch:

- `AppButton`, `AppTextField`, `AppSection`, `AppNavBar`, `AppSelectField`
- `AppWizardStepIndicator`, `AppKeyValueCard`, `AppPhoneField`, `AppRadioGroup`

## Adding a New Component

1. Create in `packages/design_system/lib/src/components/`
2. Add tokens in `packages/design_system/lib/src/theme/tokens/`
3. Export in `packages/design_system/lib/design_system.dart`

## Package Boundaries

- **design_system** = primitive, domain-agnostic UI components and tokens
- **shared_widgets** = composite, domain-aware widgets (OTP field, location field, list card)
- Never put business logic in either package
